  "id": "rocft",
  "term": "ROCFT",
  "definition": "ROCFT stands for the Rey-Osterrieth Complex Figure Test, a neuropsychological assessment in which a person copies and later recalls a complex drawing. It is used to evaluate visuoconstruction, executive planning, and visual memory, and its scoring can be done by clinicians or by automated systems.",
